  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMF Poverty Reduction and Growth Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant will enable the IMF to provide subsidised loans to eligible low-income countries.The subsidies will be funded by the PRG Trust Fund. The purpose of the lending is to assist eligible low-income countries with balance of payments needs in achieving, maintaining or restoring a stable and sustainable macroeconomic position consistent with strong and durable poverty reduction and growth.</narrative>
  </description>
